   One versionlock entry per package. Epoch 0 is stated because the plugin
   matches the full NEVRA. `-*` admits any release of exactly this version and
   nothing else, so 36.0.1 cannot match 36.0.10. #}
{% for pkg in opennms_minion_pinned_packages %}
{{ pkg }}-0:{{ opennms_version }}-*
{% endfor %}
